     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In the shop",
     "texto": [
      "When you go in, they will say **어서 오세요** (welcome).",
      "**비싸요** = it's expensive. **싸요** = it's cheap.",
      "At markets you can haggle: **좀 깎아 주세요** = give me a little discount.",
      "**카드 돼요?** = Can I pay by card? **돼요** means «it's possible», «it's OK»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
